('tef-reading-c1-012','d','reading',array['register']::text[],'The writers welcome the project but request practical checks, discussion and transparent trade-offs. “Un chèque en blanc” marks the limits of their support.','Missed detail',false,'TEF','reading','mcq','practice',array['a','b','c','d']::text[],null,'mpk-content-v2',null,0,null),
